              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la sagra — \"the village food festival\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Domenica c'è la sagra del pesce. On Sunday there is the fish festival."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Each one celebrates a local food: chestnuts, mushrooms, wine."
            }
